        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስሉ ፡ ይቀጥላል ። አንድም ፡ አፈልሰክሙ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውስተ ፡ ባቢሎን ፡ ወደ ፡ ባቢሎን ፡ አስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማርኬ ፡ እሰዳችኋለሁ ፡ እምባቢሎን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከባቢሎን ፡ ወዲያ ፡ አስማርኬ ፡ እሰዳች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኋለሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "section_title",
          "text": "ክፍል ፡ ፲፫ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": "፵፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፬ ፤ ⟪ወደብተራ ፡ ስምዕ ፡ እንተ ፡ ነበረት ፡ ኀበ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አበዊነ ፡ በገዳም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደብተራ ፡ ስምዕ ፡ ደብተራ ፡ ዘመን ፡ ደብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተራ ፡ ሕግ፡ ደብተራ ፡ ብርሃን ፡ ደብተራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መርጡል ፡ ይላል ፡ ደብተራ ፡ ስምዕ ፡ አም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልኮቱ ፡ ይመሰከርበታልና ፡ ደብተራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘመን ፡ በዘመን ፡ ተሠርታለችና ፡ ደብተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራ ፡ ሕግ ፡ ሕጉ ፡ ይነገርባታልና ፡ ደብተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራ ፡ ብርሃን ፡ ብርሃን ፡ ሠፍሮ ፡ ታይቶባታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልና ፡ ደብተራ ፡ መርጡል ፡ ሰቀለኛ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናትና ፡ በገዳም ፡ ለአባቶቻችን ፡ የተሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራች ፡ ደብተራ ፡ ኦሪት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በከመ ፡ አዘዞ ፡ ለሙሴ ፡ ዘተናገሮ ፡ ይግበራ ፡ በአር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አያ ፡ ዘአርአዮ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሳሌዋን ፡ ባሳየው ፡ በሰማያዊት ፡ ደብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተራ ፡ ብርሃን ፡ አምሳል ፡ ይሠራት ፡ ዘን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድ ፡ ለተነጋገረው ፡ ለሙሴ ፡ እንዳዘዘው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተሠራች ፡ ደብተራ ፡ ኦሪት ፡ ዘፀአ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፭ ፡ ፵ ። ፳፮ ፡ ፴ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፵፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፭ ፤ ⟪ወአብእዋ ፡ ምስሌሆሙ ፡ ሶበ ፡ ተመጠውዋ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አበዊነ ፡ ወኢያሱ ፡ ውስተ ፡ በሐውርተ ፡ አሕዛብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እለ ፡ አውጽኦሙ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ እምቅድመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገጾሙ ፡ ለአበዊነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንተ ፡ ነበረት ፡ ወእንተ ፡ አብእዋ ፡ አባቶ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቻችንና ፡ ኢያሱ ፡ ተቀብለው ፡ እግዚአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ፡ ካባቶቻችን ፡ ፊት ፡ ያራቃቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሕዛብ ፡ ወርሰዋት ፡ ወደ ፡ ነበረች ፡ ወደ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከነዓን ፡ ይዘዋት፡ የገቡ፡ ደብተራ ፡ ኦሪት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስከ ፡ አመ ፡ መዋዕለ ፡ ዳዊት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበረት ፡ እስከ ፡ አመ ፡ መዋዕለ ፡ ዳዊት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስከ ፡ ዳዊት ፡ ዘመን ፡ ድረስ ፡ ነበረች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኤር ፡ ፫ ፡ ፲፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": "፵፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፮ ፤ ⟪ዘረከበ ፡ ሞገሰ ፡ በቅድመ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ባለሟልነትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያገኘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰአለ ፡ ይርከብ ፡ ማኅደሮ ፡ ለአምላከ ፡ ያዕቆብ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የያዕቆብ ፡ ፈጣሪ ፡ ማደሪያን ፡ ሊያውቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የወደደ ፡ ታሪክ ፡ ዳዊት ፡ ኢያውሴዎንን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወግቶ ፡ ደብረ ፡ ጽዮንን ፡ አቅንቶ ፡ እሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጥድ ፡ በዝግባ ፡ ከተሠራ ፡ አዳራሽ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተቀምጦ ፡ ሳለ ፡ ነቢዩ ፡ ናታን ፡ ሊጠይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀው ፡ መጣ ፡ አዝኖ ፡ ቢያየው ፡ ምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁነህ ፡ አዝነሃል ፡ አለው ፡ እኔ ፡ አላዝን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማን ፡ ይዘን ፡ እኔ ፡ በጥድ ፡ በዝግባ ፡ ከተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሠራ ፡ አዳራሽ ፡ ተቀምጬ ፡ ታቦተ ፡ ጽዮ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ፡ ከደጅ ፡ በድንኳን ፡ እየኖረች ፡ አለው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምነው ፡ ቤተ ፡ መቅደስን ፡ አትሠራምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለው ፡ ወደ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ካላመለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከቱ ፡ ይሆናልን ፡ ወደ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አታመለክትልኝም ፡ አለው ፡ ተያይዘው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀኖና ፡ ገቡ ፡ ለናታን ፡ ዳዊት ፡ ቤተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መቅደስን ፡ እንዳይሠራ ፡ ልጁ ፡ ሰሎሞን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲሠራ ፡ ገልጦለት ፡ አኮ ፡ አንተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘትነድቅ ፡ ሊተ ፡ አላ ፡ ወልድከ ፡ ዘይወ",
